@page "/"

<PageTitle>Nuclear Evaluation</PageTitle>

<section class="ne-intro" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <h1 id="home-title">Nuclear Evaluation</h1>
    <p class="ne-intro-lead">Explore sample data, build queries, and compare isotope measurements.</p>
    <p>Follow the connections between series, samples, and measurements. Build reusable queries,
        explore isotope distributions, and preview spreadsheet data in one workspace.</p>
    <p class="ne-demo-note">This is a shared sandbox with generated example data. Changes are periodically
        reset, and uploaded files are temporary.</p>
</section>

<div class="ne-feature-cards">
    <section class="ne-feature-card">
        <RadzenIcon Icon="table_view" />
        <h2>Explore the data</h2>
        <p>Browse series, expand their samples, and filter or sort the results.
            Summary counts follow the active series filters.</p>
        <a href="data-management">Open Data Management →</a>
    </section>
    <section class="ne-feature-card">
        <RadzenIcon Icon="filter_alt" />
        <h2>Build an evaluation</h2>
        <p>Explore projects and isotope charts, or combine filters across series,
            samples, and measurements. Save a query as a reusable preset.</p>
        <a href="evaluation">Open Evaluation →</a>
    </section>
    <section class="ne-feature-card">
        <RadzenIcon Icon="upload_file" />
        <h2>Preview a file</h2>
        <p>Upload a spreadsheet or delimited text file and inspect the parsed rows.
            Start with the included sample files or the blank template.</p>
        <a href="data-management?tab=stem-preview">Try STEM Preview →</a>
    </section>
</div>
